==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|þrǫngr||narrow}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*þrangwaz}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈθrøyŋkʏr/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|øyŋkʏr|lang=is}}

===Adjective===
{{is-adj|þrengri|þrengstur}}

# [[narrow]]{{jump|is|narrow|s}}
